  "details": "We all know that Steam Frame is really something completely new and distinguishable from Meta Quest headsets. Steam Frame can easily run a large part of the Steam library without a PC. Steam Deck has a good experience with this, and Steam Frame will have higher performance, which means that VRChat on Steam Frame will obviously run quietly, and it will NOT be an Android version like on Meta Quest. I really hope and believe that Steam Frame will easily get a version of VRChat almost the same as on a PC, and will run without the PC itself",
